page_head #= language_theme_head

#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../ (Documentation) / Numbers

    # Numbers

    Moth uses `Int` for signed whole numbers and `Float` for finite real-number
    values. It avoids the large family of integer widths and implicit numeric
    conversions found in many systems languages.

    Arithmetic checks overflow, division errors and non-finite results. Literal
    spelling and operator spacing also follow one exact grammar on every backend.
]

